Vima: rkipc - power_line_frequency_mode = close vypne ochranu proti blikani

Bez toho AE drzi expozici v nasobcich 10 ms (50 Hz) a strop expozice 4 ms z IQ se neuplatni.
Pod zarivkami muzou byt v obraze pruhy.
Licence: BSD-3-Clause jako rkipc. Ve firmwaru: NE, zatim jen rkipc v /oem na desce.

diff --git a/project/app/rkipc/rkipc/common/isp/rv1106/isp.c b/project/app/rkipc/rkipc/common/isp/rv1106/isp.c
index add0982..e3e770e 100644
--- a/project/app/rkipc/rkipc/common/isp/rv1106/isp.c
+++ b/project/app/rkipc/rkipc/common/isp/rv1106/isp.c
@@ -1496,7 +1496,11 @@ int rk_isp_set_power_line_frequency_mode(int cam_id, const char *value) {
 	Uapi_ExpSwAttrV2_t expSwAttr;
 
 	ret = rk_aiq_user_api2_ae_getExpSwAttr(rkipc_aiq_get_ctx(cam_id), &expSwAttr);
